---
const canonical = new URL('/signature/', Astro.site).toString();
const gaId = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_GA_ID;
const title = 'Signature Activation — Christina Siciliani';
const description = 'A private consultation for conscious leaders. Signature Activation is the art of personal brand alignment — where being becomes brand.';
const stripeUrl = 'https://book.stripe.com/cNi9AMgos4Jw8rbd2a2Ji01';
const calendly = 'https://calendly.com/christinasiciliani/30min';
const email = 'gethealthy@christinasiciliani.com';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
<title>{title}</title>
<meta name="description" content={description} />
<link rel="canonical" href={canonical} />
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />

<meta property="og:type" content="website" />
<meta property="og:title" content={title} />
<meta property="og:description" content={description} />
<meta property="og:url" content={canonical} />
<meta property="og:site_name" content="Christina Siciliani" />

<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
<meta name="twitter:title" content={title} />
<meta name="twitter:description" content={description} />

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Pinyon+Script&family=Italiana&family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;1,300;1,400&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

{gaId && (
  <>
    <script is:inline async src={`https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=${gaId}`}></script>
    <script is:inline define:vars={{ gaId }}>
      window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
      function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}
      gtag('js', new Date());
      gtag('config', gaId);
    </script>
  </>
)}

<style is:global>
  :root{
    --ivory:#FBF8F3;
    --cream:#F4EEE4;
    --ink:#1B1714;
    --ink-soft:#3A332D;
    --muted:#7A7167;
    --line:#E6DED1;
    --hero-bg:#1F1B17;
    --hero-bg-2:#141108;
    --hero-ink:#F2E9D4;
    --gold:#C9A35B;
    --gold-soft:#A88344;
    --hero-image: url("/images/venaria-hero.jpg");
  }

  @font-face{
    font-family:"AltaStack";
    src: local("Alta Light"), local("Alta-Light"), local("Alta");
    font-weight:300 400;
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  html,body{margin:0;padding:0}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  body{
    background:var(--ivory);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:"AltaStack","Italiana","Cormorant Garamond",Georgia,serif;
    font-weight:300;font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;text-rendering:optimizeLegibility;
  }
  .wrap{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}

  .eyebrow{
    font-family:"Inter",system-ui,sans-serif;
    font-size:11px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:.38em;
    text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink);
  }
  .eyebrow.on-dark{color:var(--gold)}
  .rule{width:48px;height:1px;background:var(--ink);border:0;margin:24px 0;opacity:.6}

  .hero{
    position:relative;min-height:92vh;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    text-align:center;color:var(--hero-ink);
    overflow:hidden;isolation:isolate;
    padding:100px 24px 88px;
  }
  .hero-bg{
    position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-2;
    background:var(--hero-image) center/cover no-repeat,
      linear-gradient(180deg,var(--hero-bg) 0%,var(--hero-bg-2) 100%);
    filter:saturate(.85) brightness(.72);
  }
  .hero::before{
    content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-1;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 45%,rgba(201,163,91,.10),transparent 55%),
      linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(20,17,12,.25) 0%,rgba(20,17,12,.55) 60%,rgba(20,17,12,.88) 100%);
  }
  .hero-inner{max-width:920px;margin:0 auto}

  h1.hero-title{
    margin:0 0 20px;font-family:"AltaStack","Italiana",serif;font-weight:300;
    color:var(--gold);font-size:clamp(52px,8.4vw,124px);
    letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1.02;
    text-shadow:0 2px 36px rgba(0,0,0,.45);
  }
  .hero-script{
    margin:18px 0 26px;font-family:"Pinyon Script",cursive;color:#fff;
    font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,44px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:.005em;
    text-shadow:0 2px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.45);
  }
  .hero-sub{
    margin:0 0 44px;font-family:"AltaStack","Italiana",serif;font-weight:400;
    font-size:clamp(14px,1.35vw,19px);letter-spacing:.44em;
    text-transform:uppercase;color:#EDE1C8;
  }

  .cta{
    display:inline-block;font-family:"Inter",sans-serif;
    font-size:12px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.32em;text-transform:uppercase;
    padding:17px 36px;text-decoration:none;transition:all .25s ease;
  }
  .cta.on-dark{color:var(--gold);border:1px solid var(--gold);background:transparent}
  .cta.on-dark:hover{background:var(--gold);color:var(--hero-bg)}
  .cta.on-light{color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--ink);background:transparent}
  .cta.on-light:hover{background:var(--ink);color:var(--ivory)}

  section{padding:104px 0}
  .section-label{text-align:right;padding-bottom:36px}
  .two-col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:72px;align-items:start}

  h2{
    font-family:"AltaStack","Italiana",serif;font-weight:300;color:var(--ink);
    font-size:clamp(32px,3.8vw,54px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:.005em;
    margin:0 0 24px;
  }
  h2 em{font-style:italic;color:var(--gold-soft)}
  .lede{font-family:"AltaStack","Cormorant Garamond",serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:0 0 16px;max-width:52ch}
  p.body{font-family:"AltaStack","Cormorant Garamond",serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:0 0 14px;max-width:56ch}

  .manifesto{background:var(--cream);text-align:center;padding:112px 0}
  .manifesto .inner{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
  .manifesto p{font-family:"AltaStack","Cormorant Garamond",serif;font-weight:300;font-size:clamp(22px,2.1vw,28px);line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);margin:0 0 22px}
  .manifesto p.small{font-size:18px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:18px}
  .manifesto em{font-style:italic;color:var(--gold-soft)}
  .manifesto .triplet{font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(19px,1.6vw,22px);color:var(--ink);margin:28px auto 30px;max-width:48ch;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:24px 0;text-align:center}
  .manifesto .triplet span{display:block;margin:4px 0;text-align:center}

  .pillars{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:48px;margin-top:56px}
  .pillar{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:24px}
  .pillar .num{font-family:"Inter",sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:16px}
  .pillar h3{font-family:"AltaStack","Italiana",serif;font-weight:300;font-size:26px;margin:0 0 12px;letter-spacing:.01em;color:var(--ink)}
  .pillar h3 em{font-style:italic;color:var(--gold-soft)}
  .pillar p{font-family:"AltaStack","Cormorant Garamond",serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:0}

  .promise{background:var(--ivory)}
  .promise .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:56px;margin-top:56px}
  .promise-card h4{font-family:"Inter",sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold-soft);margin:0 0 16px;font-weight:500}
  .promise-card p{font-family:"AltaStack","Cormorant Garamond",serif;font-weight:300;font-size:20px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--ink);margin:0}
  .promise-card em{font-style:italic;color:var(--gold-soft)}

  .intensive{background:var(--cream)}
  .format-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:36px;margin-top:56px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:44px}
  .format-item .label{font-family:"Inter",sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:14px}
  .format-item .value{font-family:"AltaStack","Italiana",serif;font-weight:300;font-size:26px;line-height:1.2;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:.02em}
  .format-item .value em{font-style:italic;color:var(--gold-soft)}
  .format-item .note{font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:8px;font-family:"AltaStack","Cormorant Garamond",serif;font-style:italic}

  .close{text-align:center;padding:136px 20px;background:var(--ivory)}
  .close h2{max-width:22ch;margin:20px auto 24px}
  .close p{max-width:42ch;margin:0 auto 36px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:19px;line-height:1.65;font-family:"AltaStack","Cormorant Garamond",serif}

  footer{padding:40px 0 52px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--ivory)}
  footer .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px}
  footer .mark{font-family:"AltaStack","Italiana",serif;font-size:20px;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:.04em}
  footer .meta{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.06em}

  .founder{background:var(--ivory)}
  .founder-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:360px 1fr;gap:72px;align-items:center;margin-top:16px}
  .portrait{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/5;background:url("/images/christina-02730.jpg") center/cover no-repeat;border:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .founder h2{font-size:clamp(30px,3.4vw,46px);margin-bottom:20px}
  .founder .bio{font-family:"AltaStack","Cormorant Garamond",serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:0 0 28px}
  .founder .quote{font-family:"AltaStack","Cormorant Garamond",serif;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(20px,2vw,26px);line-height:1.45;color:var(--ink);padding-left:20px;border-left:1px solid var(--gold-soft);margin:0}

  .reserve{background:var(--ink);color:var(--hero-ink);padding:120px 0}
  .reserve h2{color:#fff;margin-bottom:12px}
  .reserve h2 em{color:var(--gold)}
  .reserve .lede{color:rgba(242,233,212,.72);max-width:56ch}
  .reserve .eyebrow{color:var(--gold)}
  .reserve .section-label{color:var(--gold)}
  .reserve-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:72px;margin-top:56px;align-items:start}
  .reserve-centered{max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;padding:0 16px}
  .offer-title{
    color:#fff;
    font-family:"AltaStack","Italiana",serif;font-weight:300;
    font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,48px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:.02em;
    margin:0 0 24px;
  }
  .offer-price{
    color:#fff;
    font-family:"AltaStack","Italiana",serif;font-weight:300;
    font-size:clamp(28px,3.2vw,40px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:.02em;
    margin:0 0 20px;
  }
  .offer-meta{
    font-family:"AltaStack","Cormorant Garamond",serif;font-style:italic;
    color:rgba(242,233,212,.72);font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;
    margin:0 auto 14px;max-width:48ch;
  }
  .offer-meta + .offer-meta{margin-bottom:36px}
  .pay-btn-center{display:inline-block;padding-left:48px;padding-right:48px;min-width:300px}
  .alt-link{
    margin-top:22px;
    font-family:"AltaStack","Cormorant Garamond",serif;font-style:italic;
    color:rgba(242,233,212,.6);font-size:12px;
  }
  .alt-link a{color:var(--gold);text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(201,163,91,.35);padding-bottom:2px}
  .alt-link a:hover{border-bottom-color:var(--gold)}

  .package{border:1px solid rgba(242,233,212,.18);padding:40px 36px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.02)}
  .package .tag{font-family:"Inter",sans-serif;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.38em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:22px}
  .package h3{font-family:"AltaStack","Italiana",serif;font-weight:300;color:#fff;font-size:clamp(26px,2.6vw,34px);margin:0 0 10px;letter-spacing:.008em}
  .package h3 em{font-style:italic;color:var(--gold)}
  .package .price{margin:20px 0 8px;font-family:"AltaStack","Italiana",serif;color:#fff;font-size:clamp(36px,4vw,52px);letter-spacing:.01em;font-weight:300;line-height:1}
  .package .price small{font-size:14px;color:rgba(242,233,212,.5);font-family:"AltaStack","Cormorant Garamond",serif;font-style:italic;letter-spacing:.02em;margin-left:8px}
  .package .desc{font-family:"AltaStack","Cormorant Garamond",serif;font-style:italic;color:rgba(242,233,212,.7);font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:14px 0 26px}
  .package ul.includes{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 26px;border-top:1px solid rgba(242,233,212,.14)}
  .package ul.includes li{padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(242,233,212,.14);font-family:"AltaStack","Cormorant Garamond",serif;font-size:15px;color:rgba(242,233,212,.85);display:flex;gap:14px}
  .package ul.includes li::before{content:"—";color:var(--gold);flex-shrink:0}

  .pay-link-panel{padding:8px 4px}
  .pay-lede{font-family:"AltaStack","Cormorant Garamond",serif;font-style:italic;color:rgba(242,233,212,.72);font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 32px}
  .pay-btn-link{display:block;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;background:var(--gold);color:#1B1714;border:1px solid var(--gold);padding:18px 24px;font-family:"Inter",sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.32em;text-transform:uppercase;transition:all .25s ease}
  .pay-btn-link:hover{background:#E0BE79;border-color:#E0BE79}
  .pay-meta{margin-top:14px;text-align:center;font-family:"AltaStack","Cormorant Garamond",serif;font-style:italic;color:rgba(242,233,212,.5);font-size:13px;line-height:1.55}
  .pay-meta .lock{display:inline-block;margin-right:6px;font-style:normal;color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:0}

  @media (max-width:900px){
    .wrap{padding:0 24px}
    .hero{min-height:auto;padding:96px 20px 72px}
    section{padding:80px 0}
    .two-col{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:32px}
    .pillars,.promise .grid,.format-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px}
    .section-label{text-align:left}
    .close{padding:104px 20px}
    h1.hero-title{letter-spacing:.12em}
    .founder-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px}
    .portrait{max-width:320px}
    .reserve{padding:88px 0}
    .reserve-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px}
    .package{padding:32px 24px}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <h1 class="hero-title">Signature Activation</h1>
    <div class="hero-script">The Art of Personal Brand Alignment</div>
    <div class="hero-sub">Where Being Becomes Brand</div>
    <a href={stripeUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cta on-dark">Begin Your Intensive</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="two-col">
      <div>
        <h2>Guiding conscious leaders to activate their signature — and allow recognition to arise <em>naturally</em>.</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="body">At the intersection of identity, perception, and presence, a different approach to branding emerges.</p>
        <p class="body">One that does not begin with strategy — but with essence. Not with visibility — but with coherence.</p>
        <p class="body">The practice centers on activating what is already true: the distinct signature that exists before positioning, before performance, before amplification.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="manifesto" class="manifesto">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="eyebrow">The Philosophy</div>
    <hr class="rule" style="margin:24px auto"/>
    <p>For conscious leaders, founders, and visionaries, branding becomes less about being seen — and more about being <em>elemental</em>, <em>resonant</em>, and <em>embodied</em>.</p>
    <p class="triplet">
      <span>Elemental in its truth.</span>
      <span>Resonant in its frequency.</span>
      <span>Embodied in its expression.</span>
    </p>
    <p class="small">When identity is refined, recognition arises naturally. When presence is aligned, authority no longer needs to be asserted.</p>
    <p>Signature Activation is the process through which <em>being becomes brand</em> — and influence becomes an extension of truth rather than effort.</p>
    <p class="small" style="margin-top:32px">This is not about building louder brands. It is about revealing inevitable ones.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-label eyebrow">The Three Qualities</div>
    <h2 style="max-width:18ch">A signature carries three essential qualities.</h2>
    <div class="pillars">
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="num">01 — Elemental</div>
        <h3>Truth <em>beneath</em> strategy.</h3>
        <p>Before positioning, before performance — the distinct signal that already exists. Our first work is to locate it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="num">02 — Resonant</div>
        <h3>Frequency <em>over</em> volume.</h3>
        <p>A signature is felt before it is read. We refine the frequency so the right audience recognizes you without persuasion.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="num">03 — Embodied</div>
        <h3>Presence <em>as</em> proof.</h3>
        <p>When identity is aligned with expression, authority needs no assertion. Influence becomes a natural extension of being.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="promise">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-label eyebrow">What Awaits You</div>
    <h2 style="max-width:22ch">A presence the right people <em>recognize</em> — without persuasion, performance, or pressure.</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="promise-card">
        <h4>A Presence That Moves First</h4>
        <p>Walk into any room — or any feed — and be understood before you speak. Your signature does the first work for you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="promise-card">
        <h4>A Brand That Attracts by Itself</h4>
        <p>No more hustling for visibility. When your frequency is clear, the right clients, opportunities, and partners find their way to you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="promise-card">
        <h4>Recognition That Feels Earned</h4>
        <p>Influence that is magnetic. Contribution that is meaningful. A name that carries weight because it carries <em>truth</em>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="intensive" class="intensive">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-label eyebrow">The Intensive</div>
    <div class="two-col">
      <div>
        <h2>A one-to-one Strategic Intensive for leaders ready to activate their <em>signature</em>.</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="lede">Delivered across four deeply personalized sessions: a 60-minute deep dive on your core strengths to start, followed by three 1:1 sessions of approximately 45 minutes each. Optional follow-up private sessions extend the work for continued refinement and embodiment.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="format-grid">
      <div class="format-item">
        <div class="label">Structure</div>
        <div class="value">4 <em>sessions</em></div>
        <div class="note">A 60-minute deep dive to open, plus three 1:1 sessions of ~45 minutes each.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="format-item">
        <div class="label">Session Length</div>
        <div class="value">45–60 <em>minutes</em></div>
        <div class="note">Private, unhurried, entirely dedicated to your signature.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="format-item">
        <div class="label">Continuation</div>
        <div class="value">Monthly <em>refinement</em></div>
        <div class="note">Optional 1:1 sessions to deepen embodiment beyond the Intensive.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="founder" class="founder">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-label eyebrow">The Founder</div>
    <div class="founder-grid">
      <div class="portrait" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div>
        <h2 style="margin-bottom:20px">Christina Siciliani</h2>
        <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:24px">Brand Signature Strategist</div>
        <p class="bio">Christina works privately with conscious founders, executives, and visionaries at the intersection of identity, perception, and presence. Her practice is rooted in a single conviction — that true influence is not produced, but <em>revealed</em>.</p>
        <p class="bio">Before Signature Activation, she spent over a decade inside the rooms where brands are made — advising leaders whose work shapes culture, capital, and collective attention. What she saw, again and again, was the same quiet gap: the distance between who a leader is and how they are perceived.</p>
        <p class="bio">Signature Activation is her answer to that gap.</p>
        <p class="quote">"Influence does not arise from effort. It arises from coherence."</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="begin" class="reserve">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 style="color:#fff;text-align:center;max-width:30ch;margin:0 auto 64px"><em>Discover</em> your signature. <em>Activate</em> your brand.</h2>

    <div class="reserve-centered">
      <div class="eyebrow" style="color:rgba(242,233,212,.55);margin-bottom:20px">The Offering</div>
      <h3 class="offer-title">Signature Activation<br />Strategic Intensive</h3>
      <div class="offer-price">CHF 555</div>
      <p class="offer-meta">Delivered privately.</p>
      <p class="offer-meta">
        Your place is confirmed upon receipt of payment.<br />
        Payments are processed securely via Stripe.
      </p>
      <a href={stripeUrl} class="pay-btn-link pay-btn-center" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Proceed to Secure Payment</a>
      <div class="alt-link">
        Or <a href={calendly} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Request a Private Consultation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="mark">Christina Siciliani</div>
    <div class="meta">Signature Activation · Private Consultations</div>
    <div class="meta">© {new Date().getFullYear()}</div>
  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
